  "details": "VRChat site lacks some crucial stuff, like you cant directly see are user are banned or not (there is no official banned banner, but you can determine if user is banned by seeing the changes in profile or using third party tools that groups are usually use to moderate lobby's).   \n\nThere is no \"reports\" section on website either, so you can`t see your reports without need to log into the game. \n\n\"Moderation report closed\" msgs are not informative, because it will be helpful to see additional info. \n\nVRChat really need to add clarity regarding the bans, that will definitely help some communities that want to keep VRC clean.",
